WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
In the early days of the Nazi regime,

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.080
they started slowly but surely taking away people's rights.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.520
And what we're seeing now is the very same thing.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.280
Same thing as the Nazi regime?

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.720
Really?

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.200
They tried to kill Trump twice already.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.560
I know he can't control himself,

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.120
but JB Beck better watch his mouth.

